cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Luv_finder in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "Luv_finder: blind spectral-line search in interferometric visibilities"
abstract: >-
  A matched filter for blind spectral-line searches in the uv plane. A Gaussian line
  template is matched against the visibilities over a grid of positions, source shapes and
  line widths, with the response in signal-to-noise units and a jackknife of the data as the
  noise reference; mosaics are corrected for the primary beam and combined, and candidates
  are catalogued and fitted in the visibilities.
type: software
